# Hermes prompt templates. Empty, and deliberately so.
#
# Hermes is the one agent here that DOES consult a model, and its two system
# prompts live in agents/nl_query/agent.py as `_PLAN_SYSTEM` and
# `_ANSWER_SYSTEM`. They stay beside the code that validates the reply: the
# planning prompt and the tool allowlist it is checked against have to change
# together, and a prompt in a separate file is a prompt somebody edits without
# reading the validator.
#
# The TODO that was here said "populate this directory". The prompts exist; they
# are just not here, which is a different thing from unwritten.
#
# Phase: 2 - Orchestrator & Investigation Flow
